// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_MuDrakhan_Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Reference 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1676591824" "A wizard's journal"
// DetailString :
"P438408143" "This appears to be the handwritten notes of a Circle Sorcerer. This one isn't written in the strange Oranbegan Language that the Circle normally uses, however, but in coloqial english: <br><br>'I still can't beleive what I saw. Even now, I feel misgivings. I tell myself it's only fragments of memories from before that cause me such distress, and writing about it in the modern tongue seems to help. But what I saw. Are we coming into this blind? We need such power, but I fear what we have brought to this world may be too much even for us to handle."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4053861224" "I have felt a change come about recently. Something strange has occurred, some unseen shadow has passed, but I do not know what cast it. If it evades even my mystic senses, then I must assume that it is a shadow of great and baleful portent. So I ask you to deliver word of this disturbance to one of my honored ancestors, who even now exists beyond life and death. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Speak of this portent to Tarixus the Mystic, and do as he bids you.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4182754575" "Speak with Tarixus of Mu'Drakhan's misgivings"
// SendOffString :
"P3035483821" "Travel to Sharkhead Isle, speak with Honored Tarixus, and do as Tarixus bids you. He is a great and powerful ancestor, and his every word is a path to knowledge."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_MuDrakhan_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3586114825" "Speak with Tarixus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1880710245" "Have you not spoken with the ancient one yet? <br><br>Curr! <br><br>Begone from my sight until you can accomplish the task I have set before you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3399743842" "The old ghost won't save you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4241250900" "Greetings, {VillainName}. So, you wish to know what disturbs this world? From my place beyond life, yet anchored to this living world, I, too, have seen the shadow that crossed Mu'Drakhan's vision. I will tell him of it, but for a price. I need something done, a minor matter. There is a small coven of Circle sorcerers gaining power in the city of Haven in Cap au Diable. Eradicate them, and I shall send Mu'Drakhan what I know. It should be no great difficulty for one of your power."

