// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_MuDrakhan_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheTablet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1073290872" "An engraved stone tablet"
// DetailString :
"P1788587383" "This ancient stone tablet is engraved on every surface with ancient Mu writing. It would likely take some time to fully translate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2961734444" "Any Civilization as glorious as the Mu leaves behind it numerous items and artifacts. And it is no surprise that these relics, filled with the wisdom and power of our forebears, draw weak and small-minded men eager to make some petty coin from their exploitation. It is to a matter such as this that I am forced to lower my attention. It seems the Tsoo, a clan of gangsters who think their meager tattoo magic elevates them somehow, have stolen an engraved stone tablet bearing knowledge of the ancient Mu. Even now, they hide it in St. Martial. This valuable historical treasure cannot be allowed to remain in their criminal hands. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would task you to recover this artifact, and teach a lasting lesson to the Tsoo  leader who would usurp the legacy of Mu for petty profit.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4082948591" "Recover tablet from the Tsoo"
// SendOffString :
"P2985949688" "You will have 2 tasks before you: First, recover the tablet. Second, reward the Tsoo fool who stole the tablet with ignominious defeat. Return when this is done. <br><br>Personally, I detest the vain ostentation of St. Martial. Every minute that tablet spends there could lessen it."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P164554703" "You will have 2 tasks before you: First, recover the tablet. Second, reward the Tsoo fool who stole the tablet with ignominious defeat. Return when this is done. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1768551125" "This is the place. Even St. Martial's people need places to store stuff."

