// Dialog :
"P2207494821" "You stopped the Circle, and prevented the binding of Baphomet"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1931121415" "You failed to stop the Circle of Thorns"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1554305871" "You arrive before me wreathed in victory! The descendants of Mu shall not forget your efforts against the machinations of the Circle of Thorns. I shall pass on word of your considerable power and skill to Lord Recluse himself for your efforts on this day."
// RandomFameString :
"P2459818516" "There was something huge and burning out on Thorn Isle, but then it was gone. Wonder what happened?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2107420655" "You would DARE to bring yourselves before me after such an ABJECT and UTTER FAILURE? <br><br>If Lord Recluse himself did not take such interest in your progress, I would have you flayed alive! <br><br>But no. This is no time for anger. How could you have known the Circle was so close to bringing the beast across? And you have succeeded in my tasks in past. My rage ebbs in the light of reason. That is the way of the Mu. And there is time yet to stop the beast. However, I don't think you will be part of those plans. Still, I shall see if there is something else I have for you to do more suited to your... capabilities."
// RandomFameString :
"P1741936637" "I saw something huge and burning on Thorn Isle. And it was laughing! The horrible, horrible laughing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_MuDrakhan_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2046532522" "To even mention this base and sacriligious event leaves a sick taste on my tongue, but speak of it I must, so that it can be solved. The vile and filthy Devouring Earth have infested a Mu excavation site. The noxious beasts have driven out my researchers and even now slither through the glorious halls of the ancients. I will not allow this! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{VillainName}! I charge you to eradicate this infestation! Wipe out the foul creatures of the Devouring Earth and cleanse the ruins of Mu!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2695789130" "Cleanse Mu Ruins of all Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P2648432167" "The task is simple: Eradicate the Devouring earth to the last rotting branch, the last slimey toad, the last cursed rock and crystal. Destroy them all and cleanse the sacred ruins of Mu."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2563566481" "Defeat all foes in ruins"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4061285264" "A thick organic heat ebbs up from the depths of the ruins. The Devouring Earth control this place now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P79805850" "Lesser Devoured"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2860416012" "New nest. <em>Deep within Earth. <em>Deep."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
