"P2443176971" "With the fool Mu'Thekesh out of the way and his faction tainted by the 'evidence' now come to light, more of the leaders among the Mu Mystics of Arachnos will side with me. Your part in this matter cannot be recorded in the records of Arachnos of course, but your fine efforts will live on within the true and secret history of the Mu. Such an honor should be sufficient for anyone."
